[com_15721]
type=text
x=48
y=7
width=147
height=17
layer=com_15715
textfont=q8_full
text=The Ballad of Jareesh
colour=0x360022

[com_15722]
type=text
x=4
y=47
width=190
height=17
layer=com_15715
textfont=q8_full
text=Clad all in the robes for She
colour=0x360022

[com_15723]
type=text
x=4
y=63
width=204
height=17
layer=com_15715
textfont=q8_full
text=we travelled north expediantly.
colour=0x360022

[com_15724]
type=text
x=5
y=90
width=270
height=17
layer=com_15715
textfont=q8_full
text=To beseech the guardians we were sent,
colour=0x360022

[com_15725]
type=text
x=5
y=108
width=221
height=17
layer=com_15715
textfont=q8_full
text=so to the river's source we went.
colour=0x360022

[com_15726]
type=text
x=4
y=135
width=237
height=17
layer=com_15715
textfont=q8_full
text=Through the cave we had to travel.
colour=0x360022

[com_15727]
type=text
x=4
y=151
width=211
height=17
layer=com_15715
textfont=q8_full
text=There was mystery to unravel.
colour=0x360022

[com_15728]
type=text
x=4
y=176
width=237
height=17
layer=com_15715
textfont=q8_full
text=We came upon a great stone door,
colour=0x360022

[com_15729]
type=text
x=2
y=193
width=223
height=17
layer=com_15715
textfont=q8_full
text=but our priestess knew the score.
colour=0x360022

[com_15730]
type=text
x=1
y=217
width=226
height=17
layer=com_15715
textfont=q8_full
text=She used the great ancestral key.
colour=0x360022

[com_15731]
type=text
x=1
y=233
width=211
height=17
layer=com_15715
textfont=q8_full
text=We passed through very easily.
colour=0x360022

[com_15732]
type=text
x=3
y=10
width=233
height=17
layer=com_15716
textfont=q8_full
text=Three great men all hewn of rock,
colour=0x360022

[com_15733]
type=text
x=3
y=24
width=267
height=17
layer=com_15716
textfont=q8_full
text=the three small chambers they did block.
colour=0x360022

[com_15734]
type=text
x=4
y=47
width=253
height=17
layer=com_15716
textfont=q8_full
text=The first all made of rock quite black,
colour=0x360022

[com_15735]
type=text
x=4
y=61
width=219
height=17
layer=com_15716
textfont=q8_full
text=our fighting men went to attack.
colour=0x360022

[com_15736]
type=text
x=5
y=82
width=261
height=17
layer=com_15716
textfont=q8_full
text=They went with Arrow, blade and spell,
colour=0x360022

[com_15737]
type=text
x=5
y=97
width=215
height=17
layer=com_15716
textfont=q8_full
text=but the man they could not fell.
colour=0x360022

[com_15738]
type=text
x=6
y=120
width=191
height=17
layer=com_15716
textfont=q8_full
text=Many men did fall that day,
colour=0x360022

[com_15739]
type=text
x=6
y=136
width=233
height=17
layer=com_15716
textfont=q8_full
text=while others turned and ran away.
colour=0x360022

[com_15740]
type=text
x=7
y=160
width=146
height=17
layer=com_15716
buttontype=1
textfont=q8_full
text=I had little hope at all,
colour=0x360022

[com_15741]
type=text
x=7
y=177
width=202
height=17
layer=com_15716
textfont=q8_full
text=as I watched my kinsmen fall.
colour=0x360022

[com_15742]
type=text
x=8
y=198
width=193
height=17
layer=com_15716
textfont=q8_full
text=My warhammer I boldy heft
colour=0x360022

[com_15743]
type=text
x=9
y=214
width=263
height=17
layer=com_15716
textfont=q8_full
text=and struck a blow which while was deft,
colour=0x360022

[com_15744]
type=text
x=1
y=13
width=274
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=should give scant harm to one so strong,
colour=0x360022

[com_15745]
type=text
x=1
y=30
width=234
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=or so I thought, nay I was wrong.
colour=0x360022

[com_15746]
type=text
x=1
y=54
width=252
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=The rock man fell down with a crash,
colour=0x360022

[com_15747]
type=text
x=2
y=69
width=254
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=which sent up clouds of dust and ash.
colour=0x360022

[com_15748]
type=text
x=1
y=92
width=168
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=Just myself left and alas,
colour=0x360022

[com_15749]
type=text
x=4
y=107
width=208
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=two more rockmen left to pass.
colour=0x360022

[com_15750]
type=text
x=5
y=131
width=239
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=Still buoyed on by my first success
colour=0x360022

[com_15751]
type=text
x=5
y=148
width=192
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=onwards bravely I did press.
colour=0x360022

[com_15752]
type=text
x=6
y=173
width=264
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=The next man was of rock hued  grey
colour=0x360022

[com_15753]
type=text
x=7
y=189
width=244
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=and this one next I planned to slay.
colour=0x360022

[com_15754]
type=text
x=6
y=214
width=216
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=Crushing blows I rained on him,
colour=0x360022

[com_15755]
type=text
x=4
y=231
width=233
height=17
layer=com_15717
textfont=q8_full
text=but things were looking very grim.
colour=0x360022

[com_15756]
type=text
y=13
width=192
height=17
layer=com_15718
textfont=q8_full
text=Not a scratch could I make.
colour=0x360022

[com_15757]
type=text
x=2
y=29
width=203
height=17
layer=com_15718
textfont=q8_full
text=Anon my limbs began to ache.
colour=0x360022

[com_15758]
type=text
y=50
width=225
height=17
layer=com_15718
textfont=q8_full
text=The rockman gave a mighty roar
colour=0x360022

[com_15759]
type=text
x=2
y=67
width=217
height=17
layer=com_15718
textfont=q8_full
text=so fierce I hurried for the door.
colour=0x360022

[com_15760]
type=text
x=1
y=90
width=201
height=17
layer=com_15718
textfont=q8_full
text=How to beat that second man,
colour=0x360022

[com_15761]
type=text
x=2
y=109
width=180
height=17
layer=com_15718
textfont=q8_full
text=to this day I have no plan.
colour=0x360022

[com_15762]
type=text
x=4
y=133
width=208
height=17
layer=com_15718
textfont=q8_full
text=My hammer never left a dent.
colour=0x360022

[com_15763]
type=text
x=5
y=150
width=244
height=17
layer=com_15718
textfont=q8_full
text=I never reached whence I was sent.
colour=0x360022

